        <div class="field"><label>Experience</label><value>4+ years (Jan 2022 – Present)</value></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Specialisation</label><value>React.js, Next.js, Django<br>Full Stack Web Development</value></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Freelance Work</label><value>Part-time Freelancer<br><em>Data Science &amp; Python development</em></value></div>
